---
import '@fontsource-variable/anek-bangla/standard.css';
import '@fontsource/iosevka/400.css';
import Tilde from '../../layouts/Tilde.astro';

const log = [
  { day: 1, what: 'print("hello"). He typed it with one finger and grinned for five minutes.' },
  { day: 3, what: 'Variables. He named every one of them after cricketers.' },
  { day: 6, what: 'if/else. A "how old are you" program. He set the cut-off for "old" at 25.' },
  { day: 9, what: 'Loops. A multiplication table up to 20, because his school stops at 10.' },
  { day: 14, what: 'His first real program, below. He showed it to our whole family at dinner.' },
];
---

<Tilde user="jannat" title="teaching rafi python" icon="🐍" description="teaching my little brother Python on mukto.net">
  <main>
    <h1>Teaching Rafi Python</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      I'm Jannat. My brother Rafi is 12 and wanted to "make a game". He's too young for his own
      account, so he sits next to me, his files live in <code>~jannat/rafi</code>, and we do 30
      minutes after his homework. This is the log.
    </p>

    <ul class="log">
      {
        log.map((l) => (
          <li>
            <span class="day">day {l.day}</span>
            <span>{l.what}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <h2>Day 14: সংখ্যা ধরো</h2>
    <pre><code>import random

number = random.randint(1, 50)
tries = 0
print("১ থেকে ৫০ এর মধ্যে একটা সংখ্যা ভেবেছি। ধরো তো!")

while True:
    guess = int(input("তোমার অনুমান: "))
    tries += 1
    if guess &lt; number:
        print("আরো বড়!")
    elif guess &gt; number:
        print("আরো ছোট!")
    else:
        print(f"ঠিক! {"{"}tries{"}"} বারে পারলে।")
        break</code></pre>
    <p class="small">
      Run it yourself: <code>python3 ~jannat/rafi/guess.py</code> on mukto.net. Next week: lists, and
      a hangman game with Bangla words.
    </p>
  </main>
</Tilde>

<style is:global>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #fdfaf5;
    color: #2d2a26;
    font: 17px/1.7 'Anek Bangla Variable', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem 1rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: #3b6ea5;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .intro {
    color: #57534e;
  }
  .log {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  .log li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #e7dfd2;
  }
  .day {
    font: 14px/1.9 'Iosevka', ui-monospace, monospace;
    color: #3b6ea5;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
  pre {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e7dfd2;
    border-left: 4px solid #f2c94c;
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  pre code {
    font: 14px/1.6 'Iosevka', 'Anek Bangla Variable', ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  code {
    font-family: 'Iosevka', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .small {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #57534e;
  }
</style>
